  "extra_vbs": "' ---- PAD: aerosmith's mechs (aerosmith.shadow.json)\n' The shadow game's \"no song yet\" (its own new-game value): left Empty, the\n' plunger lane's original UnHit would start its mode countdown timer.\nPlayerMode = -1\n' The toy box: the table drops a ball shot into ToyBoxKicker and makes new\n' ones at BallReleaseToyBox; here it is a ball stack on TOY BOX ENTER 1..3\n' (GUESS: one switch per ball held). The generated saucer stack for\n' ToyBoxKicker is swapped for this one at the first trough kick (after\n' Table1_Init built it, before any ball can reach the box).\nDim PadToyBox : Set PadToyBox = New cvpmBallStack\nPadToyBox.InitSw 0, 1078, 1079, 1080, 0, 0, 0, 0\nPadToyBox.InitKick BallReleaseToyBox, 160, 10\nPadToyBox.KickBalls = 6\nPadToyBox.IsTrough = False\nDim PadLidPow, PadLidHld, PadToyMag, PadLidWasUp\nPadLidPow = False : PadLidHld = False : PadToyMag = False : PadLidWasUp = False\n\nSub PadToyHook\n\tIf Not (bsToyBoxKicker Is PadToyBox) Then\n\t\tSet bsToyBoxKicker = PadToyBox\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\n\nSub PadTroughOut(e)\n\tPadToyHook\n\tbsTrough.SolOut e\nEnd Sub\n\n' the right eject throws the ball INTO the toy box while the game holds the\n' lid up (the table's own lob), and to the flippers otherwise\nSub PadRightEject(e)\n\tIf e Then\n\t\tIf PadLidPow Or PadLidHld Then\n\t\t\tbssw61.InitKick sw61, -36, 37\n\t\t\tbssw61.KickZ = 55\n\t\tElse\n\t\t\tbssw61.InitKick sw61, -36, 9\n\t\t\tbssw61.KickZ = 0\n\t\tEnd If\n\t\tbssw61.SolOut True\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\n\nSub PadLidPower(e)\n\tPadLidPow = e\n\tPadLidSync\nEnd Sub\n\nSub PadLidHold(e)\n\tPadLidHld = e\n\tPadLidSync\nEnd Sub\n\nSub PadToyMagnet(e)\n\tPadToyMag = e\n\tvpmTimer.AddTimer 600, \"PadToyCheck '\"\nEnd Sub\n\n' the lid follows its coils (power, then hold); TOY BOX LID (GUESS: made\n' while the lid is up)\nSub PadLidSync\n\tDim up\n\tup = PadLidPow Or PadLidHld\n\tIf up <> PadLidWasUp Then\n\t\tPadLidWasUp = up\n\t\tController.Switch(1081) = up\n\t\tIf up Then\n\t\t\tToyBox_OpenLid\n\t\tElse\n\t\t\tToyBox_CloseLid\n\t\tEnd If\n\tEnd If\n\tvpmTimer.AddTimer 600, \"PadToyCheck '\"\nEnd Sub\n\n' balls leave the box when the lid is up and the magnet lets go (GUESS)\nSub PadToyCheck\n\tIf (PadLidPow Or PadLidHld) And Not PadToyMag Then\n\t\tIf PadToyBox.Balls > 0 Then\n\t\t\tPadToyBox.ExitSol_On\n\t\tEnd If\n\tEnd If\nEnd Sub\n",
  "retrofit_timers": {
